    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported CAMCraft’s two-punch job. The control resolved both threading points and plotted 16 cutting blocks with a 1 mm separation for each punch. The traces showed no cutting transit between the punches. See #2999 for the per-work technology check.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
