    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T04:32:43Z",
    "body": "Port: this branch is now on the zero-step setup writer of #2984, stacked on #2972 (`f99a9d736`). New head: `04cec49fe`. The merge resolved five conflicts. In each, the frame version was kept and the group behaviour was added again by hand. The old script writer `jescript.rs` stays deleted. Each work now refers to the one `CCB030` quality of the piece. The old per-work names `QN2` and `QN3` are removed. The emulated control imported `PAIR20` with zero steps on each work. It gave `CCB030[4]` on each work after TECCUT and \"geen fouten\" after the formal check. The plot has the same 16 cut blocks as the original run. The PR body has the readings.",
